<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates close lower, seen falling.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates close lower, seen falling.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed lower on Monday on low exports, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates are likely to ease this week, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:			    Monday	May 29</p>
<p>    Shafiq (Gold Key brand)  410	   435</p>
<p>    MGM			    450	   465</p>
<p>    Popular			440	   455</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
